	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"You play on &eprocedural floating islands&r in the overworld — mostly air between bases."
				""
				"&7Mounts:&r **Wings Of Fire** adds **petrified phoenix eggs** to loot (vanilla structures plus this pack’s extra rolls on village, dungeon, jungle temple, and trial chamber chests when Lootr converts them). Hatch an egg on the &eleft branch&r."
				""
				"&7Travel:&r **Project Island** ropes are **public ziplines**: craft a **Harpoon Gun**, shoot two anchors on island surfaces, then **rope surf** along the line (&eempty hand&r, &enot sneaking&r — see the **right branch**). Tiered rope span and durability unlock from advancements after the harpoon step."
				""
				"&7ProgressiveStages:&r **Iron Age** still gates iron tools and the harpoon recipe in **JEI** until you smelt iron (vanilla story advancement). Stages match this book where noted."
				""
				"&7Foundation:&r The **column above** this card tracks vanilla **Stone / Iron**, reading your **island id**, **Nether** access and **blaze** fuel for WoF crafts, and a first **Create** alloy."
			]
			id: "B1DD98FB3E338D81"
			rewards: [{
				id: "C975F98B8F9C7639"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 5
			}]
			shape: "diamond"
			tasks: [{
				id: "63C879996ADAB998"
				title: "Read"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "Project Island"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
