		{
			dependencies: ["B1DD98FB3E338D81"]
			description: [
				"&7HUD:&r While you stand on a procedural island, the server may sync **nearby island beacons** — the client can show **titles / states** (see **projectisland** configs for billboard vs map pins)."
				""
				"&7Command:&r Run **/projectisland island here** with an empty-ish situation on solid terrain to print the **island key** and saved record at your feet (void columns report none)."
				""
				"Check this after you have read the output once — it is for orientation, not a speedrun gate."
			]
