				"&7Nether:&r Build a **Nether portal**, ignite it, and step through — you need **blaze rods** (→ powder) for **Wings Of Fire** cradle/lantern crafts."
				""
				"&7Blazes:&r Spawn from **Nether fortresses**. Kill Blazes for rods; craft **blaze powder** at a crafting grid."
				""
				"&7Safety:&r Bridges and fire-resistance prep matter on floating terrain — set a respawn point before risky jumps."
