			description: [
				"&7Goal:&r Have &eany one&r **petrified phoenix egg** in your inventory (task completes automatically)."
				""
				"&7Where to look:&r **Lootr** chests in dungeons, villages, jungle temples, trial chambers, pillager structures, woodland mansions, mineshafts, ancient cities, and Nether loot — eggs are rare rolls, so explore widely."
				""
				"&7Breeds:&r Fire, Wind, Red, Nature, Dark, and Gilded eggs all count. Which egg you find decides which phoenix line you hatch later; **don’t throw away** duplicates if you want backups."
			]
