				"&7Craft (shaped):&r Top row **iron bars · empty · iron bars**; middle **iron · blaze powder · iron**; bottom row **three iron ingots**."
				""
				"&7Why:&r The **Inferno Cradle** is the workstation that **warms** a petrified egg into a living **phoenix egg** for your breed. You need blaze powder from Blazes (Nether fortresses) or similar loot."
				""
				"&7JEI:&r Open **Just Enough Items** and search **Inferno Cradle** for the exact grid."
