		{
			dependencies: ["82E3B9D5C6F41A23"]
			description: [
				"&7What to do:&r Place the **Inferno Cradle** in the world and interact with it using mod **WoF** instructions (slot / fuel UI as shown in-game)."
				""
				"&7Timing:&r Warming is **real-time** and usually takes on the order of **~15 minutes** once the cradle is running — stay nearby or secure the area so chunk unloading does not pause progress."
				""
				"&7Result:&r Your **petrified … egg** becomes that breed’s normal **phoenix egg** (e.g. petrified fire → **Fire Phoenix Egg**). The task detects **any** warmed breed."
				""
				"&7Tip:&r If the mod shows optional cosmetic fire or fuel hints, follow on-screen cues; the important part is waiting until the egg item upgrades."
			]
