		{
			dependencies: ["55B6E8A09F742975"]
			description: [
				"&7Summon:&r With your **bound tempered lantern** in hand, **use** it (**right-click**) on a suitable spot in the world per **Wings Of Fire** behavior — the mod spawns your **phoenix** mount from that lantern."
				""
				"&7Afterward:&r Follow WoF tooltips for riding, items, and care. If nothing happens, verify you used the **bound** lantern (tooltip shows it is tied to a breed), you are not in a blocked dimension, and try an open area."
				""
				"Check this step once your bird is successfully summoned."
			]
