		{
			dependencies: ["B1DD98FB3E338D81"]
			description: [
				"&7Unlock:&r **Iron Age** (ProgressiveStages) reveals iron and this recipe in **JEI** after you complete vanilla **Smelt an Iron Ingot**."
				""
				"&7Craft (shaped):&r Top row **three iron ingots**; middle row **string · tripwire hook · string** (Project Island accepts the **`c:strings`** tag); bottom center **wooden stick** (`**c:rods/wooden**`)."
				""
				"&7First link:&r In the floating-islands overworld, **use** the gun while aiming at **solid island terrain** to fire the **first harpoon anchor**. **Use** again from a sensible position toward **another island** within range to place the **second** anchor and finish the **rope link**. Chat/status feedback tells you if the shot failed."
				""
				"&7Surf:&r With an **empty main hand** and **not sneaking**, **use** while near an existing link to **ride the rope** between anchors (void rescue favors island centers while surfing)."
				""
				"&7Multiplayer:&r Completed links are **world fixtures** — other players can surf **your** ropes; tier upgrades apply to **new** links based on advancements on the **right-side** quests."
			]
			icon: { Count: 1, id: "projectisland:harpoon_gun" }
			id: "7E6AB75D3E65449C"
