		{
			dependencies: ["7E6AB75D3E65449C"]
			description: [
				"&7Steps:&r With the **Harpoon Gun** selected, **use** on **solid blocks** on one island to leave the **first anchor** (projectile lands on valid terrain)."
				""
				"&7Second shot:&r From a clear line of sight, **use** again toward **another island** within **tier range** (base tier is shortest; **chain** / **netherite** tiers unlock longer spans via the quests above this one)."
				""
				"&7Success:&r Chat or action-bar feedback confirms the **rope link**; you should see anchors and the rope mesh. If the second shot fails, the first anchor may clear — reposition and retry."
				""
				"Check this quest after at least one **completed** link exists in your world (solo or multiplayer)."
			]
