		{
			dependencies: ["E1F0A000000000006"]
			description: [
				"&7How:&r Stand near an existing **rope link**, hold **nothing** in your main hand, **do not sneak**, and **use** (right-click) to **mount the line** and surf along the curve toward the other anchor."
				""
				"&7Void rescue:&r While surfing, void-related rescue logic is gentler and prefers **island centers** — still avoid jumping mid-span without a plan."
